{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項發表於《國家科學評論》的研究發現，矽酸鹽熔體在高壓下能夠容納超出傳統化學計量預期的「額外氧」。這為地球深部與地表氧化之間可能存在的聯繫提供了一種新機制，也讓研究人員重新評估古老火山活動對地球大氣演化的潛在影響。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583570.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.743951+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:36:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"154fc7d867fba0ea9fe521b8ad0f48199940de6e1677acfcc8a0525c971b630c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}